OL,3,GNEWSAIf I'd fallen asleep I'd be dead,
OL,4,Asays man who had meningitis within a
OL,5,Ayear of his brother
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo brothers who contracted meningitis
OL,8,Fwithin a year of each other say they
OL,9,Fare lucky to be alive.
OL,11,FSaul and Drew Darlington from Wrexham,
OL,12,Fnow 29 and 26, initially thought it was
OL,13,Fa "weird" coincidence they both caught
OL,14,Fthe illness as teenagers but later
OL,15,Flearnt a rare condition meant they were
OL,16,Fsusceptible.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
