OL,3,GNEWSAIf I'd fallen asleep I'd be dead,
OL,4,Asays man who had meningitis within a
OL,5,Ayear of his brother
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The day I had it, if I had gone to
OL,8,Fsleep that night, I'd have probably
OL,9,Fdied," said Saul who, along with his
OL,10,Fbrother, now wants to raise awareness
OL,11,Fof the symptoms of meningitis,
OL,12,Fparticularly amongst young people.
OL,14,FFollowing a deadly outbreak of
OL,15,Fmeningitis B in Kent earlier this year,
OL,16,Fnearly 20,000 young people have been
OL,17,Fvaccinated in Wales through catch up
OL,18,Fclinics.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
